utdoor Pool","description":"Plentiful beaches, lush hinterland and the historic harbourfront await when you escape to the stylish Rydges Newcastle. With a contemporary design and spacious rooms overflowing with coastal charm, the hotel sits in the heart of the city, just steps away from shimmering beaches, boutiques and cafés. Make the most of the glistening pool, restaurant and bar, before exploring this charming destination, affectionately known as 'Newie'.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":115,"original_price":115,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y000004v1WGAAY","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/twqrtwq3zoulnf55umli","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/dx045eu7t9jx998l0mv","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/f4mdmp672f31e4c8x11v","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2026-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Pretty Beach House","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"New South Wales","title":"New South Wales Coast: All-Inclusive Luxury Couples Retreat near Bouddi National Park","description":"Nestled in the Bouddi Peninsula just 90 minutes north of Sydney, the seven-acre Pretty Beach House property is the embodiment of Australian outback luxury. With four exquisite pavilions to choose from - Treetops Pavilion, Bayview Pavilion, Hideaway Pavilion and The Retreat - this all-inclusive haven provides unrivalled seclusion and elegance, complemented by world-class hospitality and an array of lavish amenities. Enjoy breathtaking intimate dining spaces, a wine cellar, magnificent sandstone open fireplace, infinity pool and a hand-crafted Stefano Ferrara pizza oven - all designed to make you feel at home. Authentic, earthy interiors and unique bespoke soft furnishings await, with plush mud-brick walls and sandstone floors engulfing the entire property.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":2515,"original_price":2515,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"